WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.470
♪♪

00:00:04.470 --> 00:00:05.471
-Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.471 --> 00:00:06.973
According to a new report,

00:00:06.973 --> 00:00:08.608
House Minority Leader
Kevin McCarthy

00:00:08.608 --> 00:00:10.142
has hired
former President Trump's

00:00:10.142 --> 00:00:12.411
White House political director
Brian Jack

00:00:12.411 --> 00:00:15.214
to help Republicans win back
the House in 2022,

00:00:15.214 --> 00:00:18.751
though it's unclear if Jack
can recapture the magic

00:00:18.751 --> 00:00:21.554
that helped Trump lose
by eight million votes.

00:00:21.554 --> 00:00:23.956
After Senator Bernie Sanders
criticized him

00:00:23.956 --> 00:00:27.093
on Twitter last week for his
multibillion-dollar fortune,

00:00:27.093 --> 00:00:28.994
Tesla founder Elon Musk tweeted,

00:00:28.994 --> 00:00:33.199
"I am accumulating resources
to help make life multiplanetary

00:00:33.199 --> 00:00:36.235
&amp; extend the light
of consciousness to the stars,"

00:00:36.235 --> 00:00:39.338
and then, he coughed for like
five minutes straight.

00:00:39.338 --> 00:00:41.707
[ Laughter ]
New York representative Tom Reed

00:00:41.707 --> 00:00:44.343
was accused last week
of sexual misconduct.

00:00:44.343 --> 00:00:46.512
Okay, well,
that's strike one of,

00:00:46.512 --> 00:00:48.748
apparently, thirty?

00:00:48.748 --> 00:00:50.816
Britain's Queen Elizabeth
is reportedly set

00:00:50.816 --> 00:00:54.219
to appoint a diversity czar,
after Duchess Meghan Markle

00:00:54.219 --> 00:00:56.021
accused the royal family
of racism.

00:00:56.021 --> 00:00:57.423
Because, when I think,

00:00:57.423 --> 00:00:59.792
"sensitivity
to the disenfranchised,"

00:00:59.792 --> 00:01:01.961
I think "czar."
[ Laughter ]

00:01:01.961 --> 00:01:05.031
According to reports, several
young White House staffers

00:01:05.031 --> 00:01:07.466
have been put on probation
or fired,

00:01:07.466 --> 00:01:09.068
due to past marijuana use.

00:01:09.068 --> 00:01:10.669
So, if anyone asks,

00:01:10.669 --> 00:01:13.672
this is just tobacco.

00:01:13.672 --> 00:01:17.243
Calms him down,
makes him less likely to bite.

00:01:17.243 --> 00:01:19.812
Virginia Commonwealth
University's basketball team

00:01:19.812 --> 00:01:22.515
was pulled out of the
NCAA March Madness tournament

00:01:22.515 --> 00:01:23.683
over the weekend,

00:01:23.683 --> 00:01:25.985
after several
positive coronavirus tests.

00:01:25.985 --> 00:01:27.786
And I don't want to brag, but I

00:01:27.786 --> 00:01:30.256
totally had that in my bracket.

00:01:30.256 --> 00:01:32.325
Six Flags announced
that it will reopen

00:01:32.325 --> 00:01:34.994
its theme parks in California
next month.

00:01:34.994 --> 00:01:36.829
When asked if it was safe,
they said,

00:01:36.829 --> 00:01:39.999
"I mean, as safe
as we've ever been."

00:01:39.999 --> 00:01:41.266
[ Laughter ]

00:01:41.266 --> 00:01:42.835
A wax museum in Texas

00:01:42.835 --> 00:01:45.571
recently removed a statue
of former President Trump,

00:01:45.571 --> 00:01:49.208
after it was repeatedly punched
and scratched by visitors

00:01:49.208 --> 00:01:50.410
and -- this is weird --

00:01:50.410 --> 00:01:54.547
as well as by the other
wax statues.

00:01:54.547 --> 00:01:56.182
[ Laughs ]
A representative

00:01:56.182 --> 00:01:59.185
from a sex toy company said,
in a new interview,

00:01:59.185 --> 00:02:00.286
that the next generation

00:02:00.286 --> 00:02:02.689
of artificial intelligence
sex robots

00:02:02.689 --> 00:02:06.826
will have sensors in erogenous
zones that respond to touch.

00:02:06.826 --> 00:02:08.761
So, introducing...

00:02:10.430 --> 00:02:13.599
[ Laughter ]

00:02:13.599 --> 00:02:16.435
Today was World Water Day, so,

00:02:16.435 --> 00:02:18.905
shout-out to my hose!
[hos]

00:02:18.905 --> 00:02:20.206
[ Laughter ]

00:02:20.206 --> 00:02:22.341
Scollins!

00:02:22.341 --> 00:02:25.078
Ruins World Water Day.

00:02:25.078 --> 00:02:28.180
And, you know, he thinks
he's very clever, but, uh...

00:02:28.180 --> 00:02:30.149
I saw how you spelled
the joke.

00:02:30.149 --> 00:02:34.052
[ Laughter ]

00:02:34.052 --> 00:02:36.322
And, finally, officials
in Cambridge, Massachusetts,

00:02:36.322 --> 00:02:37.589
recently approved plans

00:02:37.589 --> 00:02:39.959
for a cannabis cookie store
in Harvard Square.

00:02:39.959 --> 00:02:42.662
So, if you go to Harvard
and you love weed,

00:02:42.662 --> 00:02:45.532
I bet your dad also went
to Harvard?

00:02:45.532 --> 00:02:47.766
[ Laughter ]
And that was the monologue,
everybody.

00:02:47.766 --> 00:02:50.370
And I know what you're
thinking -- "Whoa, whoa, whoa!

00:02:50.370 --> 00:02:52.171
You didn't show that clip
of Biden tripping

00:02:52.171 --> 00:02:54.073
on the stairs to Air Force One.

00:02:54.073 --> 00:02:55.475
If Trump had tripped like that,

00:02:55.475 --> 00:02:56.976
you would've shown that clip
for a month."

00:02:56.976 --> 00:02:58.544
And you know what?

00:02:58.544 --> 00:03:00.412
You're right.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:00.412 --> 00:03:02.114
We would've done that.

00:03:02.114 --> 00:03:04.417
So, fine, here's the clip
of Biden tripping.

00:03:10.156 --> 00:03:11.690
I mean, he did run for president

00:03:11.690 --> 00:03:14.894
like eight times
before he won, so,

00:03:14.894 --> 00:03:16.195
obviously,
he's going to stick with it,

00:03:16.195 --> 00:03:17.764
no matter how many times
he trips.

00:03:17.764 --> 00:03:18.964
[ Laughter ]

00:03:18.964 --> 00:03:20.567
In the interests
of equal time...

00:03:27.039 --> 00:03:28.707
-Whoops.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:28.707 --> 00:03:29.776
-Stand by.

00:03:29.776 --> 00:03:30.843
[ Laughter ]

00:03:30.843 --> 00:03:33.612
-Ten thousand known
or suspesked --

00:03:33.612 --> 00:03:35.280
-♪ It's fun to stay at the ♪

00:03:35.280 --> 00:03:38.384
♪ YMCA ♪

00:03:38.384 --> 00:03:39.452
-You know what?
I think

00:03:39.452 --> 00:03:40.853
our Trump clips
are a little longer.

00:03:40.853 --> 00:03:42.621
[ Laughter ]

00:03:42.621 --> 00:03:44.690
We'll fix that for the repeat.

00:03:44.690 --> 00:03:46.059
It's interesting.
I feel like

00:03:46.059 --> 00:03:51.063
they're the opposite
with stairs and COVID.

00:03:51.063 --> 00:03:55.034
Like with COVID,
Trump took no precautions.

00:03:55.034 --> 00:03:57.136
Biden took every precaution.

00:03:57.136 --> 00:04:00.306
But on stairs or ramps,
Trump's super careful...

00:04:00.306 --> 00:04:01.374
[ Laughter ]

00:04:01.374 --> 00:04:02.442
...always holding the railing,

00:04:02.442 --> 00:04:03.710
going real slow.

00:04:03.710 --> 00:04:04.877
[ Laughter ]

00:04:04.877 --> 00:04:07.213
Whereas, Biden throws
caution to the wind,

00:04:07.213 --> 00:04:09.215
trips upstairs three times.

00:04:09.215 --> 00:04:11.517
[ Laughter ]

00:04:11.517 --> 00:04:13.285
So, it's interesting, you know,

00:04:13.285 --> 00:04:15.721
it just shows we all
contain multitudes.

00:04:15.721 --> 00:04:17.256
♪♪

00:04:17.256 --> 00:04:19.725
White House advisors are
reportedly set to present

00:04:19.725 --> 00:04:23.229
a two-part $3 trillion jobs
and infrastructure proposal

00:04:23.229 --> 00:04:25.931
