to a couple of broken stairs.

00:04:30.869 --> 00:04:34.073
Got to love him respecting
the rule of threes.

00:04:34.073 --> 00:04:35.107
[ Laughter ]

00:04:35.107 --> 00:04:36.576
While testifying last week

00:04:36.576 --> 00:04:37.677
before the Senate,

00:04:37.677 --> 00:04:39.746
Republican Senator Rand Paul
criticized

00:04:39.746 --> 00:04:42.415
