the coronavirus vaccine.

00:04:46.252 --> 00:04:48.187
But that's insane.
We're in a pandemic.

00:04:48.187 --> 00:04:49.956
Fauci is an epidemiologist.

00:04:49.956 --> 00:04:53.058
If you're at the zoo and you see
the lion keeper running,

00:04:53.058 --> 00:04:54.693
