left office.

00:05:09.275 --> 00:05:11.577
Yeah, of course,
and the Weather Channel

00:05:11.577 --> 00:05:14.780
always takes a hit
after hurricane season is over.

00:05:14.780 --> 00:05:17.617
Nobody ever yells,
"It's sunny and 75!

00:05:17.617 --> 00:05:20.053
Quick! Turn on the TV!"
[ Laughter ]

00:05:20.053 --> 00:05:21.587
Russian President Vladimir Putin

00:05:21.587 --> 00:05:23.389
received the
coronavirus vaccine today.

00:05:23.389 --> 00:05:25.924
He wanted to do it weeks ago,
but they had to wait

00:05:25.924 --> 00:05:30.062
for the healthcare worker's hand
to stop shaking.

00:05:30.062 --> 00:05:32.764
Vice President Kamala Harris
today swore in

00:05:32.764 --> 00:05:35.667
former Boston Mayor Marty Walsh
as Labor secretary.

00:05:35.667 --> 00:05:38.638
Walsh's first planned action
