Brad Raffensperger.

00:05:48.881 --> 00:05:50.683
And he would love it
if Brad could help

00:05:50.683 --> 00:05:53.218
find enough votes
for that guy to win.

00:05:53.218 --> 00:05:55.822
A Pennsylvania couple
is receiving attention online

00:05:55.822 --> 00:05:57.690
