on menthol cigarettes.

00:06:29.822 --> 00:06:32.825
Well, at least this storming
of Capitol won't be so bad.

00:06:32.825 --> 00:06:35.094
[ Breathing heavily ]
"Ugh! So many stairs.

00:06:35.094 --> 00:06:37.129
Let's just --
I think we'll just go home.

00:06:37.129 --> 00:06:38.698
Let's write a letter?"

00:06:38.698 --> 00:06:42.301
According to a new study,
