00:07:00.286 --> 00:07:01.954
♪♪

00:07:01.954 --> 00:07:04.990
White House Press Secretary
Jen Psaki said on Monday

00:07:04.990 --> 00:07:07.726
that President Biden and former
President Barack Obama

00:07:07.726 --> 00:07:09.728
