the same way.

00:07:11.730 --> 00:07:13.198
[ As Obama ]
Joe, uh...

00:07:13.198 --> 00:07:14.299
this could've been a text.

00:07:14.299 --> 00:07:15.968
[ As Biden ]
It's not the same!

00:07:15.968 --> 00:07:18.204
[ Laughter ]
Senator Ted Cruz

00:07:18.204 --> 00:07:19.939
criticized Democrats yesterday

00:07:19.939 --> 00:07:21.974
for their response
to recent gun violence.

00:07:21.974 --> 00:07:26.111
Apparently, he was upset that,
during a time of serious crisis,

00:07:26.111 --> 00:07:29.648
Democrats didn't even try
to go on vacation.

00:07:29.648 --> 00:07:33.118
In her defamation lawsuit
