00:08:15.794 --> 00:08:18.798
[ Laughter ]
[ Laughs ] Tip of my cap."

00:08:18.798 --> 00:08:20.099
[ Laughter ]

00:08:20.099 --> 00:08:21.400
What am I doing?

00:08:21.400 --> 00:08:24.003
I can do a British accent
and I choked on it twice.

00:08:24.003 --> 00:08:25.871
[ Laughs ]
"Tip of my cap!"

00:08:25.871 --> 00:08:31.944
[ Laughter ]

00:08:31.944 --> 00:08:34.479
Legendary director
