00:09:59.398 --> 00:10:00.699
A turkey.

00:10:00.699 --> 00:10:03.635
[ Laughter ]

00:10:03.635 --> 00:10:05.804
We got to say -- I mean, again,
I think if you're --

00:10:05.804 --> 00:10:07.640
